### STEP 13
Date: 2026-09-08
Phase: 3
Step: 13 (Fix Development Unlock - Root Cause Fix)

Files Modified:
- src/systems/SaveSystem.js

Bug Found:
- Saugat still showed lock icon despite previous fix
- Root cause: `load()` method returned early when saved data existed in localStorage
- The development unlock code only ran for fresh loads (no saved data)
- Players with existing save data never got Saugat unlocked

Exact Fix:
- Changed from early return to storing data in a variable
- Development unlock check now runs AFTER loading saved data
- Works for both fresh loads AND existing save data
- Used spread operator to avoid mutating original array

What Was NOT Changed:
- Saugat's unlock cost: still 50,000 coins
- Saugat's displayed price: still 50,000 coins
- Production behavior: still requires 50,000 coins
- Other characters: unchanged

Test Result:
- SaveSystem.js passes syntax check
- Dev server running on port 3003 without errors
- Saugat should now appear unlocked in Character Select

